The jdv package bundles cJSON v1.7.19 in src/cjson/ for JSON
serialisation. cJSON is copyright (c) 2009-2017 Dave Gamble and
cJSON contributors, distributed under the MIT license. The full
upstream notice is preserved in the header of src/cjson/cJSON.c and
src/cjson/cJSON.h. Upstream source: https://github.com/DaveGamble/cJSON

The bounded numeric output-size helper in src/json.c adapts cJSON's number
formatting logic and is covered by the MIT notice above.

The package bundles Apache Arrow nanoarrow C 0.10.0-SNAPSHOT from commit
ea215b000788ec2e94fc88bad5249290c94b01cd in src/nanoarrow/. It is distributed
under the Apache License 2.0; the upstream LICENSE.txt and NOTICE.txt are
included in that directory. The bundled flatcc runtime is also under the Apache
License 2.0; its upstream license and copyright notice are preserved in
src/nanoarrow/flatcc-LICENSE.txt. See src/nanoarrow/PROVENANCE.md for the
source revision, generation command, namespace, and file checksums.

Local modifications are tracked in src/cjson/patches/. They cover R package
checks and round-trip number output.

